# www → apex, permanent. Both hosts are attached to the Pages project, so
# without this Google indexes www.htmlradar.com and htmlradar.com as two
# separate sites and splits ranking signal between them (visible in Search
# Console). Host-based rules only apply on the matching domain — preview
# deployments (*.pages.dev) are unaffected.
https://www.htmlradar.com/* https://htmlradar.com/:splat 301
